meta {
  name: Create Test User
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/test-users
  body: none
  auth: none
}

vars:post-response {
  accessToken: res.body.accessToken
  refreshToken: res.body.refreshToken
  userId: res.body.user.id
}

docs {
  Creates a brand-new test user with no name and signs in as them. Expect a
  201 with the auth envelope and `user.name` null, which is what sends the
  app to name setup. Run Update Profile to give them a name.

  Handy as a second account: run this, then switch back with Sign In As Test
  User. Needs ENABLE_TEST_USERS=true on the server.
}
